# Candidate paired words for the HS alternating component

The rows pair words in the exact degree-100 HS generators with words in two
specified even permutations of six letters. The transition table and decoding
trees below are untrusted data. `Checks` proves all identities used by the
recognition argument in Lean's kernel.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith 16.1.5(10), printed p.1172; GLS3 Table 5.3m.
The original encoding script and its input paths are retained in `source/`.
-/

